Specifications and vendor documents
-----------------------------------

IEEE Std 1815-2012 is a licensed IEEE standard; it is not redistributed.
No text of it is reproduced.

The presets cp1243-1 and cp1542sp-1-irc reproduce the declared
capabilities of two vendor DNP3 device profiles (Siemens CP 1243-1,
document version 1.1, and Siemens CP 1542SP-1 IRC, document version 2.2,
laid out after the DNP Users Group device profile template). Only facts
(item numbers, ticked capabilities, object, qualifier and function code
rows) are used; the documents are not redistributed and no text of them
is reproduced.

